{
  "slug": "mexus-agent-team",
  "name": "Mexus Agent Team",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Standalone Markdown-only Agent Team plugin for Claude Code and Codex. Coordination happens through ordinary Markdown files in the current project:\n\nagent-team/\n├── mission-workflow.md\n├── agents.md\n└── missions/<mission-name>/\n    ├── mission.md\n    ├── agents.md\n    ├── kanban.md\n    ├── roundtable.md\n    └── squad-lead.md",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `board` (Use when showing a Web board for a Markdown-only Agent Team Mission without a Mexus server), `continue` (Use when resuming an existing active Markdown-backed Agent Team Mission in a later Claude Code or Codex session), `mission` (Use when starting a new Markdown-only Agent Team Mission with Claude Code or Codex background Agents and no…), `roundtable` (Use when opening a RoundTable proposal in the active Markdown-backed Agent Team Mission), `status` (Use when summarizing a Markdown-only Agent Team Mission from local files)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mexus-agent-team@claude-community` from `yofine/mexus-agent-team`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Mexus"
  },
